Third-party components
======================

The MIT license in LICENSE covers this repository's own work. The files and
trees listed below are vendored from upstream projects and remain under their
own terms. They are refreshed from upstream rather than edited in place; the
edit policy and refresh instructions live in .claude/rules/vendored-files.md.

Note that this repository is NOT uniformly MIT: the iTerm2 shell integration
script is GPL-2.0-or-later. Anyone reusing files from here should check this
list first.


